# ===== 默认拒绝：本仓库只收录经人工审查的文档，杜绝任何密钥/凭证/基础设施泄漏 =====
# Default deny — only curated docs are allowed in; nothing else can be committed.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!LICENSE
!assets/
!assets/*
!docs/
!docs/*
!eval/
!eval/**
!transcripts/
!transcripts/**

# 安全网：显式阻断任何可能的密钥/凭证文件（即便被误加入也会被忽略）
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.pub
*htpasswd*
*secret*
*credential*
*password*
*.gguf
*.toml
